\f0\fs24 \cf0 Metro South Chamber of Commerce (MSCC)\
\
OVERVIEW\
The Metro South Chamber of Commerce is a private, non-profit business association based in Brockton, Massachusetts. It supports and promotes the local business community through leadership in public advocacy, education, networking, information, and community development.  [oai_citation:0\'87Metro South Chamber of Commerce](https://metrosouthchamber.com/about-the-chamber/mission/)\
\
Founded in 1913, the Chamber is one of the oldest and leading business organizations in the region and is accredited by the U.S. Chamber of Commerce.  [oai_citation:1\'87Metro South Chamber of Commerce](https://metrosouthchamber.com/about-the-chamber/mission/)\
\
\
MISSION\
To serve the needs and interests of member businesses and support the economic vitality of the Metro South region.  [oai_citation:2\'87Metro South Chamber of Commerce](https://metrosouthchamber.com/about-the-chamber/mission/)\
\
\
VISION\
The Chamber aims to:\
- Support business growth and development  \
- Promote the region positively  \
- Encourage economic opportunities  \
- Advocate for businesses at policy levels  \
- Strengthen the overall business environment  [oai_citation:3\'87Metro South Chamber of Commerce](https://metrosouthchamber.com/about-the-chamber/mission/)\
\
\
MEMBERSHIP\
Businesses can join the Chamber online or by submitting an application.\
\
Membership benefits include:\
- Networking opportunities with other businesses  \
- Marketing and advertising exposure  \
- Access to business resources and programs  \
- Educational workshops and seminars  \
- Access to health and insurance programs  \
- Cost-saving benefits and discounts  [oai_citation:4\'87Metro South Chamber of Commerce](https://metrosouthchamber.com/membership/join/)\
\
Membership helps businesses grow, build connections, and become part of a strong regional network.  [oai_citation:5\'87Metro South Chamber of Commerce](https://metrosouthchamber.com/membership/join/)\
\
\
EVENTS\
The Chamber organizes a wide variety of events, including:\
- Business networking events (e.g., Business After Hours)  \
- Workshops and training sessions  \
- Community events and open houses  \
- Industry and leadership programs  \
\
Events are listed on the Chamber calendar and updated regularly.  [oai_citation:6\'87Metro South Chamber of Commerce](https://metrosouthchamber.com/)\
\
\
BUSINESS RESOURCES\
MSCC provides support services such as:\
- Business assistance programs  \
- Workforce and employment resources  \
- Financing and loan programs  \
- Business development tools  \
- Regional studies and guides  \
\
Examples:\
- Business Assistance Center  \
- Business Front Door  \
- Metro South Business Resource Guide  \
- Brockton Business Loan Program  [oai_citation:7\'87Metro South Chamber of Commerce](https://metrosouthchamber.com/)\
\
\
ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT\
The Chamber supports economic growth by:\
- Promoting local investment  \
- Supporting businesses and entrepreneurs  \
- Running leadership and professional programs  \
- Connecting businesses with opportunities  \
\
Programs include:\
- Leadership Metro South  \
- Young Professionals programs  \
- Regional development initiatives  [oai_citation:8\'87Metro South Chamber of Commerce](https://metrosouthchamber.com/)\
\
\
REGION SERVED\
The Chamber serves multiple communities in the Metro South region, including:\
- Brockton  \
- Bridgewater  \
- Easton  \
- Stoughton  \
- Randolph  \
- Avon  \
- Canton  \
- Sharon  \
- Whitman  \
(and several others)  [oai_citation:9\'87Metro South Chamber of Commerce](https://metrosouthchamber.com/about-the-chamber/mission/)\
\
\
WEBSITE FEATURES\
The MSCC website allows users to:\
- Join the Chamber  \
- Explore the member business directory  \
- View upcoming events  \
- Access business resources  \
- Read news and updates  \
\
It acts as a central hub for businesses, members, and the community.  [oai_citation:10\'87Metro South Chamber of Commerce](https://metrosouthchamber.com/)\
\
